= Experimental Methods

We evaluate two ways of locating the first error in a given reasoning trace.

- *@llm judge:* asking a language model to judge the complete trace.
- *Context relevance:* scoring each step by how much its likelihood depends on the question and preceding reasoning.

We run both methods on the same traces with the same five models. @experiment-overview illustrates the two evaluation paths.

