== Benchmarks

Each benchmark pairs a problem with an #gls("llm")-generated _reasoning trace_ and an annotation identifying its first erroneous step or marking it as _clean_. A correct final answer does not guarantee an error-free trace. @bench-overview summarizes the tasks and error rates.

